          "block_content": "10\n\n1工\n\n(2- γm) 0.1T IGulkana T \n\n0.01—□Himalaya \n\n0.001\n\n1200130014001500160017001800\n51005200530054005500\nAltitude (m a.s.I.)\n\n",
